  "This device can send files to other devices but other devices cannot send files to this device.": "此應用程式可以向其他裝置傳送檔案，但其他裝置無法向此裝置傳送檔案。",
  "This is most likely a firewall issue. You can solve this by allowing incoming connections (UDP and TCP) on port {port}.": "這很可能是防火牆問題。您可以透過允許通訊埠 {port} 上的連入連線 (UDP 和 TCP) 以解決此問題。",
