  "This device cannot discover other devices.": "本裝置無法探索其他裝置。",
  "Please make sure that all devices are on the same Wi-Fi network and share the same configuration (port, multicast address, encryption). You can try to type the IP address of the target device manually. If this works, consider adding this device to the favorites so it can be automatically discovered in the future.": "請確保所有裝置都在同一個 Wi‑Fi 網路上並共用相同的設定 (通訊埠、多點傳送位址、加密選項)。您可以嘗試手動輸入目標裝置的 IP 位址。如果這樣可以運作，考慮將此裝置新增至最愛，以便未來可以自動偵測到。",
  "Both devices cannot discover each other nor can they share files.": "兩部裝置無法探索彼此，也無法分享檔案。",
  "Does the problem exist on both sides? If so, you need to make sure that both devices are on the same Wi-Fi network and share the same configuration (port, multicast address, encryption). The Wi-Fi network may not allow communication between participants due to Access Point (AP) Isolation. In this case, this option must be disabled on the router.": "兩部裝置都有這個問題嗎？若是，請確認兩部裝置已連線至相同的 Wi‑Fi 網路，且使用相同的設定（通訊埠、多點傳送位址、加密選項）。Wi‑Fi 網路可能因為啟用了「無線存取點（AP）隔離」而不允許裝置彼此通訊。請在路由器上停用此選項。",
